ind":"update","title":"Demo update: clearer building menus and support ranges","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing the Riverside demo and sharing feedback. This update makes it easier to see what a building will do before you spend your scrap. A clearer building menu Larger artwork for the selected building, with its details together in one panel. Less repeated text, so the main choices are easier to read. Adjusted spacing and compact layouts for smaller screens. Know what your rigs will earn {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46287186/a4a928d56a9b278be9766fa6012bc1e1fac5a2bf.png Rig income and th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:54:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030445","verified_at":"2026-10-22T02:43:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5177150-1846651706689034","game_id":"steam-5177150","kind":"announcement","title":"Fallen Nights is in Steam Next Fest. Can you make it to the boat?","summary":"One river. One boat. One way out. Fallen Nights is part of Steam Next Fest, October 19–26! Try the free Riverside demo. Gather scrap during the day, choose your perks, and build defenses before the zombies arrive at night. Your goal is to repair the boat and get away. There is one catch: repairs and defenses need the same scrap. How much will you spend to survive tonight, and how much will you save for your escape? New here? Start with Riverside. A voice on the radio will help you get started. T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689034","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5177150-1846651706679488","game_id":"steam-5177150","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: radio calls, clearer builds, and a smoother escape","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played the Fallen Nights demo and shared feedback. This update helps you find your way to the boat, see how your build works, and keep a record of your best runs.Fallen Nights is joining Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26. The free Riverside demo is available now. Thank you for helping me make it better.Radio calls and musicA veteran now speaks to you over the radio at the start of a fresh run. He explains the boat, scrap, and your escape.Two more calls mark the boat be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:50:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5177150-1846018067929527","game_id":"steam-5177150","kind":"announcement","title":"The Fallen Nights Demo Is Live on Steam!","summary":"Today I released the free demo of Fallen Nights. Seeing something I’ve been building become a game people can actually download and play is a big moment for me. Scavenge during the day, build your defenses, and survive the zombies at night. Your goal is to repair the boat and escape. But every bit of scrap spent keeping yourself alive is scrap you could have put toward getting out. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46287186/9def1876bc9d0a0d8ac6acbf93be36fb651e915c.jpg I’d love for you to give it a try and tell","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:53:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929527","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:54:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5177150-1845383656386057","game_id":"steam-5177150","kind":"announcement","title":"The Fallen Nights Demo Arrives October 8","summary":"The free Fal